### Page.createIsolatedWorld

Source: https://chromedevtools.github.io/devtools-protocol/tot/Page

Creates an isolated world for the given frame.

```APIDOC
## Page.createIsolatedWorld

### Description
Creates an isolated world for the given frame.

### Parameters
- **frameId** (FrameId) - Required
- **worldName** (string) - Optional
- **grantUniveralAccess** (boolean) - Optional
- **contentSecurityPolicy** (string) - Optional

### Response
- **executionContextId** (Runtime.ExecutionContextId) - Execution context of the isolated world.
```

--------------------------------

### Page.addScriptToEvaluateOnNewDocument

Source: https://chromedevtools.github.io/devtools-protocol/tot/Page

Evaluates a given script in every frame upon creation, before any of the frame's scripts are loaded.

```APIDOC
## Page.addScriptToEvaluateOnNewDocument

### Description
Evaluates given script in every frame upon creation (before loading frame's scripts).

### Parameters
- **source** (string) - Required
- **worldName** (string) - Optional - If specified, creates an isolated world with the given name.
- **includeCommandLineAPI** (boolean) - Optional - Specifies whether command line API should be available to the script.
- **runImmediately** (boolean) - Optional - If true, runs the script immediately on existing execution contexts or worlds.

### Response
- **identifier** (ScriptIdentifier) - Identifier of the added script.
```
